 base paths\\n\\nRemoves the overly restrictive spaBase path check from isSafeReturnUrl.\\nSame-origin matching is sufficient to prevent open-redirect attacks.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Nethmi Rodrigo <nethmi.dilinika@gmail.com>\\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>\",\"authorName\":\"omeri innocent\",\"authorEmail\":\"innocentomeri08@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"0a053ef44442e145cb520405936f84141ea2d000\",\"date\":\"2026-05-08T14:02:25-04:00\",\"message\":\"(fix) Switch to using CSS properties\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Ian\",\"authorEmail\":\"ian.c.bacher@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"323b0ea0ed01b584da3cd1868310753448aebfc3\",\"date\":\"2026-05-09T01:39:45+08:00\",\"message\":\"(feat) O3-5027: Make login page configurable (#1762)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* (feat) O3-5027: Add configurable background and announcement banners to login page\\n\\n* Fix title prop to default to empty string\",\"authorName\":\"Ujjawal Prabhat\",\"authorEmail\":\"UjjawalPrabhat1@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"8881aa5298f2a07687e723e8e15a8bc8e70b8c9c\",\"date\":\"2026-03-23T09:58:11-04:00\",\"message\":\"(feat) O3-5440: Provide a way to redirect to custom URL on login and logout (#1657)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"* (feat) O3-5440 provide a way to redirect to custom URL on login and logout\\n\\n* address feedback\\n\\n* Apply suggestions from code review\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>\\n\\n* address sonarcloud error\\n\\n---------\\n\\nCo-authored-by: Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com>\",\"authorName\":\"chibongho\",\"authorEmail\":\"cbho@pih.org\"},{\"hash\":\"18d1830642dd46e4ce1f3722435170837a068df1\",\"date\":\"2026-01-30T03:07:11+05:30\",\"message\":\"(fix) Translate iconDescription strings for accessibility (#1564)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Soham Dhande\",\"authorEmail\":\"sohamdhande1562007@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"a20c547a853ddb9430c3ae1f4ed96db1324b4095\",\"date\":\"2026-01-10T04:50:30+05:30\",\"message\":\"(fix) O3-5243: Restore browser autofill support for login credentials (attempt #2) (#1523)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Ujjawal Prabhat\",\"authorEmail\":\"UjjawalPrabhat1@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"12ae92760842750e17b54b3fd1958a5f40e74f54\",\"date\":\"2025-12-09T14:19:50-05:00\",\"message\":\"Revert \\\"(fix) O3-5243: Restore browser autofill support for login credentials…\\\" (#1519)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"This reverts commit 710685d2a4ca89fb23b9e7a197e1d9d401865d44.\",\"authorName\":\"Brandon Istenes\",\"authorEmail\":\"bistenes@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"710685d2a4ca89fb23b9e7a197e1d9d401865d44\",\"date\":\"2025-12-09T22:24:22+05:30\",\"message\":\"(fix) O3-5243: Restore browser autofill support for login credentials (#1509)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"Ujjawal Prabhat\",\"authorEmail\":\"UjjawalPrabhat1@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"7269bbfce72d1550e0a1c7aef6175b2cddee40ef\",\"date\":\"2024-12-16T16:19:16+03:00\",\"message\":\"(refactor) Improve footer component and a11y (#1240)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"This PR is a follow-up to https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-core/pull/1192 that makes the following changes:\\r\\n\\r\\n- Extracts footer styles to a dedicated stylesheet\\r\\n- Replaces the `Button` Carbon component with a `Link` component for the \\\"Learn more\\\" button\\r\\n- Adds error handing for the logo image loading\\r\\n- Improves a11y with aria labels\\r\\n- Adds a type annotation for the `Logo`` interface\",\"authorName\":\"Dennis Kigen\",\"authorEmail\":\"kigen.work@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"a5851a18ea7554b0c0ad72d296726f34c326671f\",\"date\":\"2024-12-15T20:01:28+03:00\",\"message\":\"(feat) O3-4100 - Login flow single-page redesign (#1192)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"suubi-joshua\",\"authorEmail\":\"78343336+suubi-joshua@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"5e52